#### **Empty/Loading/Error state conventions:**
- **Loading**: `TSPageLoader` or `TSSpinner` while `phase == .loading`
- **Empty**: `TSEmptyState(title: "...", systemImage: "...")` when `phase == .empty`
- **Error**: `TSErrorDisplay(onRetry: { model.refresh() })` when `phase == .error`
- **Content**: normal view hierarchy when `phase == .content`

